---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于">
  <section class="about animate-in">
    <h1 class="page-title">关于</h1>

    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-avatar">
        <div class="avatar-ring">
          <div class="avatar-placeholder">T</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>张风捷特烈</h2>
      <p class="about-bio">学海无涯，苦作舟。热爱技术，热爱分享。</p>

      <div class="about-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/toly1994328" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      </div>

      <div class="about-section">
        <h3>关于这个博客</h3>
        <p>这是一个记录个人学习与成长的技术博客。内容涵盖 Flutter、前端、算法等多个方向。希望通过写作来沉淀知识，也希望能帮助到同样在学习路上的你。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gradient-start), var(--gradient-end));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-avatar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .avatar-ring {
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gradient-start), var(--gradient-end));
    padding: 4px;
  }

  .avatar-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .about-bio {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .about-links a {
    padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  .about-links a:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .about-section {
    text-align: left;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  .about-section h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-section p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
</style>
